description:
Mechanisms exist to mitigate Harvest Now, Decrypt Later (HNDL) risk by minimizing an adversary's ability to collect long-lived data through Zero Trust Network Architecture (ZTNA) that enforces:
(1) Continuous authentication;
(2) Data microsegmentation;
(3) Least privilege; and
(4) Identity-based access control.

